<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><br />
<span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:=""><strong>&Ouml;RNEK BELGELER:</strong></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:=""><strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: underline;">&Ouml;SYM Belgesi:</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;de &uuml;niversite sınavlarına giren bir &ouml;ğrenci, yurt dışında başka bir &uuml;niversiteye m&uuml;racaat eder ve bu &uuml;niversite kendisinden T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;de nereleri kazandığına dair bir &Ouml;SYM belgesi ve lise diploması ister.</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">Bu &ouml;ğrencinin yapması gereken:</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">Terc&uuml;me B&uuml;rosu: &Ouml;SYM belgesi ile lise diplomasının orijinalini alarak yeminli bir terc&uuml;me b&uuml;rosuna veya yeminli bir terc&uuml;mana gidip, belgeyi ibraz edeceği &uuml;lkenin lisanına &ccedil;evirisini yaptırır.</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">Noter: Bu &ccedil;eviri, terc&uuml;me b&uuml;rosunun veya terc&uuml;manın yemin zaptının bulunduğu noterlikte onaylattırılır.</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">Valilik/Kaymakamlık: Noterde onaylanan bu terc&uuml;me illerde valiliğe, il&ccedil;elerde kaymakamlığa (noterin bulunduğu il ve il&ccedil;edeki) g&ouml;t&uuml;r&uuml;lerek tasdik ettirilir (apostil). Artık bu belge taraftar diğer bir &uuml;lkede ibraz edilebilir. &nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:=""><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: underline;">T.C. Kimlik Belgesi:</span></span></span></strong></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><br />
<span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">Kimlik Belgesi &ldquo;Apostil&rdquo; yapılmak istenirse noter onaylı olması gerekmektedir. Aksi takdirde apostil işlemi ger&ccedil;ekleştirilemez.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:=""><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: underline;">Ticari Evraklar:</span></span></span></strong></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;de bir şirket, başka bir &uuml;lkede şube veya temsilcilik a&ccedil;mak ister. Bu &uuml;lke ise şirketten ana s&ouml;zleşmeyi, kuruluş s&ouml;zleşmesini ister.</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:=""><strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: underline;">Şirketin yapması gereken:&nbsp;</span></strong><br />
&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:=""><strong>Terc&uuml;me B&uuml;rosu:</strong>&nbsp;Şirket, ana s&ouml;zleşmesinin onaylı bir suretini (veya resmi gazetede yayınlananı) yeminli terc&uuml;me b&uuml;rosuna veya yeminli bir terc&uuml;mana giderek ibraz edilecek &uuml;lkenin lisanına &ccedil;evirisini yaptırır.</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:=""><strong>Noter:</strong>&nbsp;Bu &ccedil;eviri, terc&uuml;me b&uuml;rosunun veya terc&uuml;manın yemin zaptının bulunduğu noterlikte onaylattırılır.</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;" trebuchet="" vertical-align:="">Valilik/Kaymakamlık: Noterde onaylanan bu terc&uuml;me illerde Valiliğe, il&ccedil;elerde Kaymakamlığa g&ouml;t&uuml;r&uuml;lerek tasdik ettirilir (apostil). Artık bu belge taraftar diğer bir &uuml;lkede ibraz edilebilir.</span></span></span></p>
</div>
